[{"title":"九日同邵长孺程无过汪元初程虞仲出东直门游邵家庄","author":"欧大任","text":"赐萸分左掖，问菊向东陵。\n金埒秋盘马，雕台晚放鹰。\n漠南凭远啸，蓟北拥孤登。\n大将收长策，清朝颂中兴。\n风云愁态减，筋力少年矜。\n赏剧归鞍月，松门万树灯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":6800,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送黄岩袁明府","author":"欧大任","text":"双凫忽以至，万里谒龙颜。\n玉帛劳诸使，鹓鸿散近班。\n装轻趋驿骑，地远问江关。\n父老家家望，闾阎事事閒。\n衙开沧海上，花扑赤城间。\n省俗眉曾察，谈诗手自删。\n盘涡龙伯屿，委羽鹤翁山。\n仙令宁留滞，徵书计日还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":6801,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"舍弟经季至","author":"欧大任","text":"知汝征途苦，因予万里行。\n衣裘南粤路，鞍马北燕城。\n拂剑星开鞘，弹冠雪满缨。\n乡心收涕泪，家庆集柴荆。\n欢剧盘餐薄，谈深烛烬明。\n梦曾劳谢客，宦颇愧陈平。\n剪白嗤班级，思玄隐姓名。\n羊肠身已历，燕颔事何成。\n下泽车犹待，西枝宅可营。\n五千言未著，六百俸非荣。\n法护难为弟，元方但似兄。\n歌堪棠棣萼，义急脊令情。\n清世宜蜚遁，荒田足耦耕。\n相将归旧隐，登陟望秦京。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":6802,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"答叶化甫弃官还家见寄","author":"欧大任","text":"傲吏归来蚤，中庭半部蛙。\n一州仅如斗，双鬓已成华。\n释子仍供米，门人尽赐麻。\n藏多芸阁籍，隐得桂丛花。\n小构曾专壑，初衣自剪霞。\n金鹅逢大药，沧海问浮家。\n客梦罗阳石，乡心浪泊沙。\n令人思叶令，凫舄在天涯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":6803,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"初夏同黎惟敬李于美张元易及舍弟经季集顾叔潜宅得桐字十二韵","author":"欧大任","text":"宫罗犹未解，下直日华东。\n偶尔寻王掾，相携就阮公。\n白云团野竹，清露引新桐。\n藓上书帷碧，榴然药籞红。\n形骸忘世外，啸傲似山中。\n馔出齐眉妇，衣牵着膝童。\n谈诗羞刻鹄，操技薄雕虫。\n酿得初蒸黍，酣宜旋折菘。\n南薰凉枕簟，西爽动帘栊。\n林冰开濠濮，丹青扫岱嵩。\n斋前松楚楚，几下石濛濛。\n割肉期三伏，披襟尚可同。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":6804,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"再谒长陵十六韵","author":"欧大任","text":"天门今再入，瞻忆十年曾。\n日月翔龙地，松楸下马陵。\n帝功成靖难，祖德侍中兴。\n蓟北嘉禾兆，燕州赤兔乘。\n渡江屯虎豹，截海上鹍鹏。\n风急青冥动，星高紫极升。\n纂图开禹服，佐命得尧朋。\n台古还招骏，田稀尽放鹰。\n敕躬金作砺，纳谏木从绳。\n兵以犁庭出，威非绝幕矜。\n禽胡铭始勒，嗣夏统先承。\n清水铜符下，榆川玉几冯。\n隧城深结搆，华表突崚嶒。\n万国传遗令，千官奉大烝。\n玄宫河岳气，银海雁凫灯。\n欲奏思文颂，抽毫愧未能。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":6805,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"大暑同李明府过千佛寺访澧公八韵","author":"欧大任","text":"忻逢陶令约，一过远公居。\n贝叶时犹诵，桦皮手自书。\n江鸥分半席，林虎傍前除。\n慧日亭亭住，慈云冉冉舒。\n舌波诸海里，头雪五台馀。\n热恼身何病，清凉性亦虚。\n梦应通蠡泽，社尚结匡庐。\n悟后求真我，浮生信六如。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":6806,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十月一日","author":"欧大任","text":"视朝颁玉历，宵旰实忧勤。\n日月尊周正，乾坤散楚氛。\n帝心资一德，天意在斯文。\n阙下衣冠气，师中虎豹群。\n荣光披禁闼，曙色起风云。\n奏以三雍乐，铭之五釜勋。\n马骄秋不贡，河徙岁偏闻。\n疏凿方宣力，骁雄几冠军。\n万几劳有问，上策更何云。\n别殿班仍肃，千官仗忽分。\n歌诗随例废，谏草避人焚。\n尚有渔樵客，迟回恋圣君。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":6807,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"马文庄公挽词","author":"欧大任","text":"黄阁丝纶重，丹衷日月新。\n三朝劳大老，一代识名臣。\n昔入金銮直，曾分翠釜春。\n抡材收杞梓，教胄藉陶甄。\n周雅菁莪盛，尧年雨露匀。\n南宫司礼乐，东省领冠绅。\n相以阿衡贵，班今力牧邻。\n重华咨四岳，北斗贯三秦。\n日切岩廊地，天扶社稷身。\n诗书尊旧学，舟楫在斯人。\n忽报中台坼，俄惊大梦真。\n圣情频惨恻，朝士共悲辛。\n琬琰勋庸录，丹青想像辰。\n人知于定国，家有范纯仁。\n漫漶曾怀刺，瞻趋似饮醇。\n扫门长揖客，从此忆平津。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":6808,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题乾公画二首 其一","author":"欧大任","text":"寒山半夜钟，寥寥雁声过。\n不知秋已深，高僧白头坐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":6809,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题乾公画二首 其二","author":"欧大任","text":"河口孤舟月，松间一塔灯。\n木鱼何处起，应礼少林僧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":6810,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题东方朔图","author":"欧大任","text":"小儿是岁星，朝游王母家。\n海山桃实成，献寿来烟霞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":6811,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"僧慧永写经室画梅二首 其一","author":"欧大任","text":"西方一卷书，此中自玄觉。\n春在维摩室，天花半空落。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":6812,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"僧慧永写经室画梅二首 其二","author":"欧大任","text":"万木冻西壑，夜禅雪窗白。\n山深人不来，惟有罗浮客。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":6813,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"正月四夜雪霁自海子骑还显恩寺用明月照积雪为韵五首 其一","author":"欧大任","text":"银海花边过，瑶林镜里明。\n高楼吹玉笛，半是陇头声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":6814,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"正月四夜雪霁自海子骑还显恩寺用明月照积雪为韵五首 其二","author":"欧大任","text":"燕门城似铁，太行石为碣。\n征人一骑还，何处关山月。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":6815,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"正月四夜雪霁自海子骑还显恩寺用明月照积雪为韵五首 其三","author":"欧大任","text":"冰天万里照，猎火仍残烧。\n惟看灞上归，不见军中啸。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":6816,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"正月四夜雪霁自海子骑还显恩寺用明月照积雪为韵五首 其四","author":"欧大任","text":"雁飞霰频积，马饥冻犹策。\n谁怜东郭生，尚作长安客。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":6817,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"正月四夜雪霁自海子骑还显恩寺用明月照积雪为韵五首 其五","author":"欧大任","text":"金堤楸树折，北风布衣裂。\n萧条认寺灯，青毡一斋雪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":6818,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题刘仲修所藏杂画四首 其一","author":"欧大任","text":"鸟下湘江来，颇自怜香草。\n羡尔碧兰花，不怨秋风早。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":6819,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题刘仲修所藏杂画四首 其二","author":"欧大任","text":"残荷烟水清，照影双鹅白。\n黄庭一卷书，谁似山阴客。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":6820,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题刘仲修所藏杂画四首 其三","author":"欧大任","text":"蒲萄更马乳，岂及安石榴。\n凿空西使返，正是汉家秋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":6821,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题刘仲修所藏杂画四首 其四","author":"欧大任","text":"露满华林园，绛实临窗里。\n佳人把玩时，房房爱多子。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":6822,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题礼公画竹二首 其一","author":"欧大任","text":"海上洛迦山，现我大士影。\n萧萧翠竹风，此中有深省。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":6823,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题礼公画竹二首 其二","author":"欧大任","text":"不二是法门，悟者阿罗汉。\n一枝青琅玕，孤峰白云涧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":6824,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"东讲堂对雪戏答熊可行","author":"欧大任","text":"苍云何处飞，白雪一以快。\n君莫问竹林，兰亭幸犹在。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":6825,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山居杂咏为顾玄言赋十八首 其一 顾令公祠","author":"欧大任","text":"灵源蔽芾树，庆自神君贻。\n祠下繁簪弁，来歌祖德诗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":6826,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山居杂咏为顾玄言赋十八首 其二 回赏寮","author":"欧大任","text":"山气夕更佳，徙倚云千叠。\n不知客在旁，手笏拄吾颊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":6827,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山居杂咏为顾玄言赋十八首 其三 峣峥阁","author":"欧大任","text":"凿翠抗山楹，窗前片黛横。\n朱帘闲自捲，临眺郁峥嵘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":6828,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山居杂咏为顾玄言赋十八首 其四 龙谷关","author":"欧大任","text":"箭栝通一门，九龙出盘谷。\n青牛何时来，日暮候樵牧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":6829,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山居杂咏为顾玄言赋十八首 其五 苍松障","author":"欧大任","text":"云平百泉山，涛响积金涧。\n谁云陶外兵，不学嵇中散。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":6830,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山居杂咏为顾玄言赋十八首 其六 沃亭","author":"欧大任","text":"移得沃洲山，无数金庭树。\n雨后石楠花，流过西亭去。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":6831,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山居杂咏为顾玄言赋十八首 其七 慧台","author":"欧大任","text":"心应无住生，慧由定中出。\n持有摩尼珠，东照扶桑日。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":6832,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山居杂咏为顾玄言赋十八首 其八 荫界","author":"欧大任","text":"大千吾世界，百万须弥山。\n谁如坐具地，日待慈云还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":6833,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山居杂咏为顾玄言赋十八首 其九 石雪濑","author":"欧大任","text":"瀑飞滚滚花，石漱粼粼玉。\n曾思三百滩，雪下扁舟宿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":6834,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山居杂咏为顾玄言赋十八首 其十 怀陆馆","author":"欧大任","text":"楚客天门下，来烹第二泉。\n从今知顾况，怀寄有高篇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":6835,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山居杂咏为顾玄言赋十八首 其十一 丈室","author":"欧大任","text":"面壁在室中，一片少林石。\n有客立门前，不知雪三尺。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":6836,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山居杂咏为顾玄言赋十八首 其十二 卢仙井","author":"欧大任","text":"仙人卢至柔，千年有遗甃。\n泠然泂酌亭，辘轳汲春溜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":6837,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山居杂咏为顾玄言赋十八首 其十三 曲引","author":"欧大任","text":"峻岭茂林中，觞流石泉白。\n因知秉兰人，不但山阴客。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":6838,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山居杂咏为顾玄言赋十八首 其十四 修竹埤","author":"欧大任","text":"十万翠琅玕，阴霏洒寒云。\n周遭渭滨宅，何可无此君。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":6839,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山居杂咏为顾玄言赋十八首 其十五 啸林","author":"欧大任","text":"先生久不言，空有鸾凤音。\n求之千载上，抱膝知此心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":6840,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山居杂咏为顾玄言赋十八首 其十六 古梅冈","author":"欧大任","text":"璨山在何处，月淡江南春。\n深林客来少，或有罗浮人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":6841,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山居杂咏为顾玄言赋十八首 其十七 涧影矶","author":"欧大任","text":"石上芙蓉栈，双塔挂寒影。\n中有百维摩，悠然发深省。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":6842,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山居杂咏为顾玄言赋十八首 其十八 茶岕","author":"欧大任","text":"铛贮中泠白，筐提谷雨青。\n闭门深不出，来著陆生经。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":6843,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送邢子愿出宰南宫","author":"欧大任","text":"燕酒垆头送别离，南亭双旆拥轻飔。\n河流似带胡卢下，秋色如花钜鹿吹。\n云起常山谈赵剑，风来东海奏齐诗。\n共知才子今循吏，丹陛行看赐对时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":6844,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"显恩寺馆雨中和答黄僚长君庆","author":"欧大任","text":"十里垂杨督亢亭，爱君诗句破沉冥。\n能从函谷占真气，愧似金门隐岁星。\n含景未酬腰下剑，阴符新解箧中经。\n荒斋细雨愁沾湿，谁遣青丝绾玉瓶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":6845,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送梁孔适试令仁和","author":"欧大任","text":"虎林佩印路偏赊，楼橹东连海上霞。\n万弩射江开甸服，千舟出浦载烟花。\n使君葑外湖为业，处士梅边鹤是家。\n交戟此时逢圣主，岂令留滞在天涯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":6846,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送陈宪副道襄备兵天雄","author":"欧大任","text":"玺书亲捧出彤闱，三辅屯兵护汉畿。\n大陆秋驱雕马去，浊漳寒挂玉龙飞。\n楼前清啸听芦管，戍后严更列羽旂。\n曾是十年持斧地，内台今召使君归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":6847,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"诏问边事有感","author":"欧大任","text":"十行频下问边陲，侦虏今劳几万师。\n左地虽羁诸校尉，乌孙犹苦两昆弥。\n颇勤聚米谈兵事，正及飞刍实塞时。\n金印绯衣殊锡久，不知何以答恩私。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":6848,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"凉州曲","author":"欧大任","text":"何处笳声咽陇头，蓬婆城下不胜秋。\n霜飞白草惊胡走，月照黄河入汉流。\n上策尽休搜套卒，中原新拜富民侯。\n羌西夜夜梅花落，烽火关山满戍楼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":6849,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送范宫谕赴留都掌院","author":"欧大任","text":"衣冠供帐潞河桥，君向陪京望斗杓。\n经幄久兼周史职，词垣新领汉宫僚。\n铜扉山色仍三殿，铁锁江声似六朝。\n鱼藻欢歌明主待，北来鹓鹭满云霄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":6850,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送顾叔潜使辽阳便归无锡省觐","author":"欧大任","text":"辽西使者下南徐，归舞斑衣慰倚闾。\n画有虎头痴更甚，酒称光禄醉何如。\n桐花夜月将雏曲，橘子秋风报客书。\n第二泉甘君莫恋，故人相待蓟门车。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":6851,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"王太史胤昌奉使上寿太夫人","author":"欧大任","text":"婺星元只傍三台，寿母华筵向此开。\n笙奏紫鸾千里至，书传青雀五云来。\n汝南月旦乡人重，洛下风烟使者回。\n会见汉宫师事礼，东征谁似大家才。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":6852,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"答王中丞元美喜余待诏公车之作","author":"欧大任","text":"苍茫三载别姑苏，书报郧阳已入都。\n再出敢言名下士，自怜不得府中趋。\n河东日给宁须酒，江上秋归岂待鲈。\n祇为清时深恋主，一官终合老潜夫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":6853,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送大司马汪公请告归省二首 其一","author":"欧大任","text":"千官供帐出都亭，司马名题在御屏。\n开府旧持沧海节，行边新扫幕南庭。\n剑寒北斗河流白，社僻东林岳色青。\n几杖更操彤管去，门人将受漆园经。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":6854,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送大司马汪公请告归省二首 其二","author":"欧大任","text":"陈情表上五云间，阊阖初分曳履班。\n未许留侯辞相国，暂容安石请东山。\n黄花酿熟舆扶醉，青玉箱擎药驻颜。\n归去里门趋入谒，玺书行召石君还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":6855,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送汪仲淹从长公南归因怀仲嘉","author":"欧大任","text":"公车辞去问山林，曾笑东方共陆沉。\n佩绾赤虹江水阔，骑归紫燕岳云深。\n家惟令弟如何点，侠过诸兄更季心。\n海内才名看竞起，蓟门犹待北来音。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":6856,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻子与入贺不果怅然有怀同敬美作","author":"欧大任","text":"十载飘零涕泪残，几传消息满长安。\n无诸城远秋相忆，督亢亭荒月自看。\n岳牧瑞难逢尔辑，风尘冠更待谁弹。\n即今万事俱华发，欲伴东溟一钓竿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":6857,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"苏子川张元易二光禄见过","author":"欧大任","text":"步兵署里一时贤，二客相寻愧地偏。\n庭下数来能系马，杖头交揖惯无钱。\n星随公子青丝辔，花照先生绿玉船。\n莫向中朝誇大隐，藤萝堪自到诸天。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":6858,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"答纪判官自亳州以论草玄草诸刻见寄","author":"欧大任","text":"谯国闻君少定居，行随使者治河渠。\n官非小吏羞题版，人似西游强著书。\n谒舍宾朋三语后，公车笔札十年馀。\n秋深一望江枫路，憔悴谁能荐子虚。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":6859,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"吴明卿至都门先枉见赠次韵奉答","author":"欧大任","text":"西序恩沾玉井冰，圣朝曾忝尺书徵。\n不知讲后鳣三报，差恋穷来酝几升。\n无恙青山秋渐爽，将归白发岁频增。\n十年握手君犹健，经术人推佐中兴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":6860,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"明卿入贺携其二子至同敬美谦之出访报国寺","author":"欧大任","text":"匹马趋朝自大梁，故人相见鬓苍苍。\n金门入簉千鹓鹭，珠树来栖两凤凰。\n五玉肃将虞后贽，三花欢上汉臣觞。\n共知太室搜书异，咫尺看君奏建章。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":6861,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"万寿节赐宴钞","author":"欧大任","text":"貂冕嵩呼奉至尊，班随台斗护微垣。\n凤凰声起和仙乐，日月旂开夹殿门。\n璧荐鹿皮秦地献，酒分马乳汉宫樽。\n同时拜赐臣何幸，十载浮沉始受恩。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":6862,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"午门献俘侍班纪事 其一","author":"欧大任","text":"卤簿初齐散晓烟，西山秋色凤楼前。\n歌成鸣鸟笙镛间，礼定牵羊玉帛先。\n曾忆肩遗经汉月，今来面缚望胡天。\n藁街已近蛮夷邸，飞檄仍传过九边。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":6863,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"午门献俘侍班纪事 其二","author":"欧大任","text":"千官侍从肃鹓行，鼓吹麾幢满建章。\n绝幕策成中执法，请缨生致左贤王。\n枚皋赋咏能持管，方朔诙谐更上觞。\n万里誇胡非羽猎，不劳明主幸长杨。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":6864,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}}]